# Loaded by Vite ONLY in dev mode (`vite` / `vite dev`), never in `vite build`.
# Points the SPA's API client at the local Laravel backend (Option B —
# direct cross-origin calls, no Vite proxy). Backend CORS already allows it.
# Value is the backend ORIGIN only; src/lib/api.js appends `/api`.
VITE_API_BASE=http://127.0.0.1:3004
